  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Piloting Digital Villages in Central Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the piloting of &apos;1000 Digital Village Initiative (DVI)&apos; of FAO, the digital transformation of the agriculture sector in Kyrgyzstan and of rural communities Uzbekistan and Tajikistan will be advanced and access to knowledge, linkages and markets will be fostered.  In particular, this project aims to achieve the enhanced access to information, knowledge, market opportunities, and linkages of smallholder farmers, youth, women and other vulnerable population in Kyrgyzstan, Uzbekistan and Tajikistan.</narrative>
  </description>
